{"server":"cn","storyId":"act39side_level_act39side_st03","groupId":"act39side","stageId":"act39side_st03","title":"别了，大地","storyCode":"EP-ST-3","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_st03.txt","sourceHash":"d710d8e078451a131bfa48d012dd1e0e726e18aebe95c3d04f71aa6d09bbbb9a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"跟随哈维尔的船员们回到镇子，跟随胡安娜的船员们准备与棘刺一同出海，帕斯卡拉去寻找她的好生活，每个人都选择了各自想要的未来。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g13_ibtown_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只剩下这一艘完好的盐船，其他的多多少少都有受损，但大部分构件和材料都能拆下来用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这本是盐船的设计图纸，上面边边角角地附带点开船技巧。这张是盐漠地图。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，好，我都要！要是真的能从盐漠里走，商队能省不少时间！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你出个价吧，我们爽快点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个数，要全用多布隆金币结。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，没问题！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给，你看看，钱是不是对的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！那我先走了，你们继续忙！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这人怎么这么爽快......哈维尔，我是不是要少了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......怎么了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"哈维尔追上去两步，顺着绳子爬上了甲板。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g3_newdeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个舵轮我留下了！多少钱？我退给你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，哦，舵轮啊！这可是一艘船上最重要的东西呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要拿回去？那我要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个数。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，表情别这么难看啊，老兄！刚刚交易已经达成了，它们现在是我的船了，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公平交易嘛，看它在你心里值不值得这个价了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜啊，那下次有机会再交易咯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g13_ibtown_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——船员们！都过来吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些就是刚刚卖盐船得来的钱，我们平分，一人一份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿了这笔钱，就去干你们自己想干的事情吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给，鲁斯，你的份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实在的，我还没有想好我接下来要去做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做个决定，很简单的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......之前，我想的是离开胡安娜，安稳点。后来我觉得你也是个疯子，跟着你也不会安稳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在我站在这个镇子里，看着镇上这些人，又瘦又干，眼睛里一点光都没有......这里过的真是安稳日子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我不在这里，去别的地方，以我那些海盗本事，能过得上安稳的日子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说出来不怕你笑话，我其实挺佩服蒂奇的。她比我大几岁，一直都很有主见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那天，我看到她伤成那样，还是打定主意要跟着胡安娜出海......真犟啊......也真够厉害，我可能就没这个胆子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......不说我了。你呢，哈维尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我应该会换个地方开个餐馆吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......就这样吧，抽完这支烟，我也就上路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人嘛......谁又能知道呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"盐船逐渐远去，哈维尔望着那白色的风帆和鲁斯的背影一并消失在视线里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他把自己的那份钱收进口袋，向着下一个路口，走远了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，这个多少钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车队的商贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"一个银币。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车队的商贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"也是一个银币。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，不贵嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那这个、这个和这个，都给我包起来，放到我后面这辆车上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车队的商贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞！哎呦，您买这么多东西，这是要去哪啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想要就买了，怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车队的商贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"没怎么，您看到什么想要的直接和我说就好！我都包好了送您车上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，这还差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......买了衣服买了首饰还买了各种小玩意......怎么还是感觉少点什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......少点什么呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车队成员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）......对啊，你也很震惊吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车队成员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）但我怎么知道会这样啊？天啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......嗯？他腰带上的那个卡扣真好看啊......亮闪闪的......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是什么做的，金属？宝石？......好想要......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好想要啊......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车队成员A","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）......那只不过是他们在路上偶然发现的东西，就挖出来带着了，想着随便卖点钱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车队成员B","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）有人收吗？真没想到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（没注意到我，马上就能拿到了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车队成员A","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）......谁能想到他们居然开了这个价钱......这个数！你下半辈子都不用愁了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车队成员B","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）所以咱们这次去也是干这个的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘿......到手！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车队成员A","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）对......去哥伦比亚，我们挣笔大的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（挣笔大的？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"帕斯卡拉把手一松，卡扣稳稳地落回了那人的腰带上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么挣笔大的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车队成员A&B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车队成员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么偷听别人说话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是别人，我可不会这样搭话的，但两位老兄，看起来极为出众，很不一般呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才敢这样冒昧上前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我的路费，去哥伦比亚这么远，路上无聊，两位老兄给我也讲讲呗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g6_olddeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人，我们真的要出海了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......居然真的会有这样的一天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，是的，小珍珠，我们是要出海了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真不敢相信......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"胡安娜拢了拢被风吹乱的头发，望向身后。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊西多，这下我们真的一无所有了，但我打定心思想要出海。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还愿意和我们一起走吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜女士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以当我的大副吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，我的船长，准备好了......嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来我的老朋友在闹脾气了......让我看看有什么办法能让她消消气。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g6_olddeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这几十年的老传动核心，果然还是受不住新装的动力系统吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......温蒂已经乘着她改造的小艇回去了，我们只好自己修修看了。船上还剩什么材料？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊西多，你的那个包里有什么东西，怎么这么鼓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是极境之前塞给我的东西，但都没什么用，我都不知道到底是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先拿出来看看，说不定有用呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊西多打开自己的背包，里面塞满的东西一下子全掉了出来。\n胡安娜和蒂奇凑上前，翻看起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？维生素片？这个是出海需要的东西啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通讯设备和防水靴也是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些工具......好像可以拿来修船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，极境真是个好小伙子，这些东西现在可不好找呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这两样我先拿走了，估摸着能解决一下刚才的问题。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你的表情，你不知道这些事？这么多东西，难道是我们分开的那天他给你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......那天我们没有道别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前段时间，他隔一阵子就塞给我一个，我都放到包里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来，他早就看出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至，比我自己还要早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的好兄弟还能看不出你的心思吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好了，问题解决了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"解决了？那我们可以出发了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呦呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"出海——出海——出海——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，船长，该决定我们航行的方向了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊西多从胡安娜的手中接过望远镜。\n无垠的盐漠上盐粒随风翻涌，像雪白的浪花，但他的视线飞快地掠过了这片虚假的海，投向极远处的天边，投向那一抹亮蓝的栖所。\n他独自一人站在了船头，伸出自己的手臂，看着上面的光芒流转，等待着它给出一个方向。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g14_ibtown_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"他站在街上，刚刚合起了手掌，夜空中最后一粒星光的碎屑也消散殆尽，黑暗再次笼罩下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"烟花结束了，我们走吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊喜的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走吧走吧，该回家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"narration","text":"路人们纷纷散去，曾因他而聚集起来的人们，又离开了他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小伊西多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g6_olddeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"胡安娜见他迟迟没有反应，便大步上前，蒂奇也跟着踏上了舰艏的甲板。\n船员们一个接一个地凑上前，想看看他们的新船长究竟看到了什么。\n于是，伊西多的身边围满了人，直到落在后面的船员不得不伸着脖子挤进人堆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么，什么？船长你到底在看什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"着急的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是还没有找到方向吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"往哪里开才是海？我们现在开的方向对吗？"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊西多没有回答他们的问题，他只是专注地看着自己的手臂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它怎么一直在转来转去的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"着急的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它什么时候才会指方向啊？哪里才是我们要去的地方呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......我们会去向哪里呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别急，别急，我们的船长会告诉我们答案的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么现在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该去往的方向是哪里呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"仿佛是在回答他的提问一般，他手臂上的流光不再毫无规律地游走，而是笔直且坚定地向天边漾起涟漪。\n他向往着和身边这群伙伴一起开向那传说中广袤无垠的海洋，于是心相原质为他指出了大海的方向。\n船员们欢腾起来，朗姆酒泼洒出来——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那里！是那边！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是大海！"},{"type":"narration","text":"所有人的目光都聚集在伊西多的身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下令吧，船长！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"船员们的手中已经拿上了帆绳，胡安娜的手也放在了舵轮上，只等他下一句命令。\n伊西多深吸一口气，回望向那些期盼他开口的赤诚目光，他发自内心地感到，自己此刻不再惧怕承担起这份期盼。\n盐漠上的风吹向他，他觉得如释重负。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"船员们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拔起船锚，升起船帆——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_1039_thorn2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我们出海！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船员们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"出海——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船员们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿——呦——！♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_i13"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亢奋的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要和海浪搏斗！我要在风浪上航行！我要与雷电击剑——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要找到埋藏在深海的宝藏！闪闪发光的金币！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是......但是......我刚刚在想，我们现在因为想要一起出海才聚在了一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"会不会未来有一天，我们有了不同的想法，就不会再在一起了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，未来？那也离现在太远了，小子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不论未来会怎么样，现在我们是在一起的，我们会一同出海！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别想那么多，拉紧你手里的帆索！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊西多船长，酒已经在手中，来说一句吧！"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊西多站上船头，空气中的水汽逐渐丰盈起来，他感受到了这种令人兴奋的潮湿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"敬远方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g6_olddeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......哼哧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......哼哧......哼哧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？什么声音？怎么这么熟悉......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......哼哧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啾叽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宝宝？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宝宝！你还活着！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（狂舔胡安娜的脸颊）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是来和我们一起出海的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（兴奋地弹来弹去）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，你真是我的好宝宝！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g1_saltdesert_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"一道血痕从氤氲的蒸汽中延伸开去，蔓延向无边无际的盐漠深处。\n冰冷的舌头品尝着口腔中的血腥，残缺的四肢由一股无主的强烈欲望驱使着向前挪动。\n不远处，一条触肢挣扎着破开盐层，向着它久违的日光蠕行。而后是第二条、第三条......\n另一股无主的强烈欲望驱使着暗淡的发光器官向太阳高高扬起，仿佛要从中借得光芒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他只是想活下去，它也只是想活下去。\n不择手段，不择形态。\n人的残躯与海嗣的残骸挣扎着，蠕动着，饥渴地互相吞噬。\n它们将永生地行走大地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
